						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14164#msg14164"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14164#msg14164">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1745 on:</b> February 02, 2005, 01:23:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was just reading back on the progression of some of the guilds... I am in LoS now and we just took down Grummus&nbsp; we are activly progressing to elemental access.&nbsp; We are currently backflaging so all our current members and alliance members&nbsp; are flaged.&nbsp; We are working our way to time.&nbsp; I just love this guild they are awesome when it comes down to raiding time and they are very organized.&nbsp; We had about 50 or more for a trouncing of Grummus so if this is a sign to come I can&#039;t wait!<br /><br />As far as DF...well they are still around but i never see them raid...grouped with some of them last night but as far as a raid force I don&#039;t think they have it anymore.<br /><br />Eshebala<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
