									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14194#msg14194">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1750 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 08:27:20 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							its not like any of the raids are exactly hard, when all you have to do is send a tell to someone on another server, and ask for the strat, or look it up online.<br /><br />and again, even when you beat Noqufiel, it wont be the same as when Ascent beat the Origional Noqufiel.&nbsp; he&#039;s been nerfed hardcore, and no ammoun of gloating will make it anywhere near the accomplishment as it was when he was killed in his origional form.<br /><br />not to mention a completely new expansion, new aa&#039;s/spells blah blah blah..... get off your high horse, your nothing special.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
