							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14194#msg14194">Quote from: Toastie on February 03, 2005, 08:27:20 am</a></div><div class="quote">not to mention a completely new expansion, new aa&#039;s/spells blah blah blah..... get off your high horse, your nothing special.<br /></div><br />At a time when guilds are folding fairly quickly, the mere fact that some guilds are able to hold a raid force together, and complete new content <b>is</b> something special.  Congratulations to any guild who is making forward progression these days, whether its DA/EiE, Conviction, RoS, Inner Loop, Brewmasters, League of Sozobon or any other guild.  You&#039;ve survived where many others have fallen.
